        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek AP-86349, Sandcast Bronze Rail Refrigerator Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Rail Sandcast Bronze Appliance Pull features the industrial chic look that has gained in popularity over the years. Choose from flat black bronze, medium bronze, and white bronze finishes. The Sandcast Bronze Rail Refrigerator Handle comes packaged with everything you'll need to install it on your fridge or other kitchen appliance panel. It is available in 12 inch and 18 inch center to center lengths.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/sandcast-bronze-rail-cabinet-pull-emtek-86332\"><b> Rail Cabinet Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Emtek Rail Refrigerator Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Sandcast Bronze</li>\r\n<li>Pull Mounting: Standard 3/4\" Thick Appliance Panel</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-AP-86349-specififcations.pdf?v=1704262358\"><b>Emtek Rail Pull Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>EMT-AP-86349:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Width: 9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Base: 13/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-AP-86350:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 18-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Width: 9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Base: 13/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-sandcast-finish.jpg?v=1704354510\" width=\"570\" height=\"191\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
